<title>UK: Rabobank sets $50 million Dec 2001 FRN.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets $50 million Dec 2001 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DKB International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **31.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+30 BP    PAY DATE   S10.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  100.25    FULL FEES  25 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) 100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/NL/DE/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *SUBJECT TO A CAP OF 6.80 PCT</p>
<p>	     **CALL 31.DEC.99 AND EACH INTEREST PAYMENT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
